{"@context":["https://litlfred.github.io/folio-assistant/ns/content/v1.jsonld",{"@base":"https://litlfred.github.io/folio/"}],"@id":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/rem-electron-period-base-cohomology","@type":["folio-assistant-core:Remark","doco:Section"],"label":"rem:electron-period-base-cohomology","kind":"remark","title":"Cohomological role of CAL-1: $m_e$ as the $h^0$ scale of the $W$-Hodge plane","uses":["papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-electron-period-base"],"interprets":"papers/quantum-observable-universe/blocks/prop-electron-period-base","tags":["cal-1","electron-period","cohomology","w-hodge-plane","calibration"],"text":"electron-period-base-cohomology.md","provenance":"authored","html":"<p><a id=\"rem:electron-period-base-cohomology\"></a>\n<strong>Remark.</strong> <em>Cohomological role of CAL-1: <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">m_e</code> as the <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">h^0</code> scale of the <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">W</code>-Hodge plane</em></p>\n<p>The electron scale <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">m_e</code> enters the <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">n=2</code> period <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">a_D^{(2)} = \\tau\\,a_D^{(1)} - m_e</code> explicitly rather than as an overall prefactor. This reflects the cohomological role of CAL-1: <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">m_e</code> fixes the scale of the rank-2 <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">W</code>-Hodge plane, the <code class=\"language-math math-inline\">h^0</code> datum of the archimedean realisation.</p>\n"}
